     "text": "The VDP has one 8-bit status register, read by the CPU, holding the interrupt flag F, the coincidence flag C, the fifth sprite flag 5S and the fifth sprite number.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:TMS9918.raw.txt",
       "lines": "834-837",
       "sha": "2996fa110fe2998d4e46fb19e66680e604998a43d730508bb48a94aed3b68ab8"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "2",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "The capture's status-register line reads F 5S c FIFTH SPRITE NUMBER.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:TMS9918.raw.txt",
       "lines": "622",
       "sha": "2c41e7a25848c28bccf01ccf8b7e47fcc34f675b54c360ce06ed46226d2b1c33"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "3",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "The status register may be read at any time to test F, C and 5S.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:TMS9918.raw.txt",
       "lines": "838",
       "sha": "76451b4470dcdab0d0f93bfb8c9731113707e6b4bbeaeb22075aa5a035cc0ec5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "4",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "F is set to 1 at the end of the raster scan of the last active display line.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:TMS9918.raw.txt",
       "lines": "841-842",
       "sha": "9ef1880e203f55a426af865e381e60bf0107c1228be8009e2df7640b88b1d607"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "5",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "F is reset to 0 after the status register is read or when the VDP is externally reset.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:TMS9918.raw.txt",
       "lines": "842-843",
       "sha": "14af651d48d75787ed08f26cfb350572cbc83a3d072b2b9e2a537fde548dbef8"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "6",
     "on": "read",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "Reading the status register clears F, and an asynchronous read can reset the frame flag and miss it.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:TMS9918.raw.txt",
       "lines": "838-840",
       "sha": "0d533061e5b22e508d4b723b0b11245cf377764326e09c5143d5dd11c29471e9"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "7",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "The status register should be read only when the VDP interrupt is pending.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:TMS9918.raw.txt",
       "lines": "838-840",
       "sha": "0d533061e5b22e508d4b723b0b11245cf377764326e09c5143d5dd11c29471e9"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "8",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "The status register needs to be read frame by frame to clear the interrupt and receive the next frame's.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:TMS9918.raw.txt",
       "lines": "845-846",
       "sha": "8fa8f2a5694a80eaecf3fa0b22b3a07b5449fa81026566ca58992bcfbcdb3467"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "9",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "If the interrupt enable bit of register 1 is 1, the INT output is active low whenever F is 1.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:TMS9918.raw.txt",
       "lines": "843-844",
       "sha": "5c854a3e95963429a093a9fc01037d5021a09e1ead3469416abc77d9d692803e"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "10",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "C is set to 1 if two or more sprites coincide, which means one overlapping pixel.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:TMS9918.raw.txt",
       "lines": "847-849",
       "sha": "56503fbf6439f8ccda82455d870394e2458bf1b9e414b5b9635f752c160069be"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "11",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "Transparent sprites and those partly or wholly off-screen are considered for coincidence; sprites beyond the sprite attribute table terminator are not.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:TMS9918.raw.txt",
       "lines": "848-850",
       "sha": "4aef90728c8fea27fc5351c1385bd4fd81303c509783836022355a3caebb3888"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "12",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "C is cleared to 0 after the status register is read or the VDP is externally reset.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:TMS9918.raw.txt",
       "lines": "850-851",
       "sha": "5f0d176caa92bcc8efc65175df36584fb3f5f1015c4cb3fda2ba4f27b3f71fa6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "13",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "The status register should be read immediately on power-up to reset the coincidence flag.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:TMS9918.raw.txt",
       "lines": "851-852",
       "sha": "ffe8ad960b9be192c1aa693a67ff7c03b0eff851ee498c67f1e6214da7aaee98"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "14",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "The VDP checks each pixel position for coincidence every 1/60 s for the TMS9918A and TMS9928A and every 1/50 s for the TMS9929A.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:TMS9918.raw.txt",
       "lines": "853-855",
       "sha": "a8467cf3314c037c2d340802a619af3ebf0db595f5c988798a5eb53d4f974341"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "15",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "5S is set to 1 whenever five or more sprites are on a horizontal line, lines 0 to 192, and F is 0.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:TMS9918.raw.txt",
       "lines": "858-860",
       "sha": "1544316b756a55fef761ba4a997dd1d209ce3324778f379a072958c187a2d9ad"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "16",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "5S is cleared to 0 after the status register is read or the VDP is externally reset.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:TMS9918.raw.txt",
       "lines": "860-861",
       "sha": "21fcf51cdd51e75bac8bc2cbde74db160a8fe0db74f9708da7a629990e82de06"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "17",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "The fifth sprite's number is placed in the lower 5 bits when 5S is set and is valid while 5S is 1.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:TMS9918.raw.txt",
       "lines": "861-862",
       "sha": "d11b3aceb3353b02dd0daff59ed168f6efdb213f516a9473c3e6a56d34335110"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "18",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "Setting the fifth sprite flag does not cause an interrupt.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:TMS9918.raw.txt",
       "lines": "862",
       "sha": "decfb5644064553666438e8f3c64813bbc212eba8067dee18c7fe903074fdd86"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "101",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "differs",
     "row": "11",
     "text": "MAME counts a coincidence only for pixels inside the 256-pixel active area, so a sprite wholly off-screen there is not considered.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/video/tms9928a.cpp",
       "lines": "613-617",
       "sha": "608e38abcd72e0b9551dfccd82822343f274bdf495ad3cb130c5153e26344d44"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "19",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "Moving sprites more than one pixel position between checks can let them overlap several pixels or pass over each other unseen.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:TMS9918.raw.txt",
       "lines": "856-857",
       "sha": "56585f7881e1e8962e55e8a3e8ed18e437c24943b63c39fea993b02ff542dadb"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
